{"title":"Human","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Human that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>92,088</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=1\">Lv 1 <span>19,772</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=7\">Lv 7 <span>107</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>72</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>13,314</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>630</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>7,784</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>49</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>7,469</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/human?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</t